-- #3185: `List`'s bare "index out of bounds" (the recursive impl decrements
-- the index on its way down and loses the original) now names the CALLER's
-- original index, matching every other container. Index 5 into a 3-element
-- list — not the first recursion step — proves the original value survived
-- the recursion rather than the boundary case alone.
main = println [10, 20, 30][5]
